  <section id="data-access-api">
<h1>Data Access API<a class="headerlink" href="#data-access-api" title="Link to this heading"><i class="fas fa-link"></i></a></h1>
<p>The Data Access API provides programmatic download access to the files stored in a Dataverse installation.
More advanced features of the Access API include format-specific transformations (thumbnail generation/resizing for images; converting tabular data into alternative file formats) and access to the data-level metadata that describes the contents of the tabular files.</p>
